<title>USA: FGIC qualifies four muni issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies four muni issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said it has qualified for bond insurance the following four municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Kings Mountain, N.C., $7.02 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Washington Township, N.J., $6 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Philipsburg Area School District, Pa., $7 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Park City School District, Utah, $10 million school building GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
